{"id":"n57724-1-9","stage":4,"title":"미달 · 未及","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57724-1-9-1","ko":"민준이는 벌써 결석이 육십 일이 넘어요.","zh":"敏俊缺课已经超过六十天了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이는","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결석이","meaning":"缺席，缺勤","explanation":"결석：缺席，缺勤；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"결석","audio":"/audio/9862fb8a54b995f22c39.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15967","senseId":"1","lemma":"결석","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"육십","meaning":"六；十","explanation":"육：六；십：十","readings":[{"term":"육","audio":"/audio/432a18159c59981fc3bc.mp3"},{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70820","senseId":"1","lemma":"육","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"28847","senseId":"1","lemma":"십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일이","meaning":"日","explanation":"일：日；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62598","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넘어요.","meaning":"过，超过","explanation":"넘다：过，超过；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"넘다","audio":"/audio/bd8fe9471c90dfb81875.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64524","senseId":"1","lemma":"넘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"9862fb8a54b995f2","term":"결석","zh":"缺席，缺勤","audio":"/audio/9862fb8a54b995f22c39.mp3","entryId":"15967","definition":"不去学校或不出席会议等正式场合。","pronunciation":["결썩"]},{"id":"432a18159c59981f","term":"육","zh":"六","audio":"/audio/432a18159c59981fc3bc.mp3","entryId":"70820","definition":"五加一所得的数目。","pronunciation":["육"]},{"id":"c7470d030eddae16","term":"십","zh":"十","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3","entryId":"28847","definition":"九加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["십"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"日","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"62598","definition":"计算日或日子的单位。","pronunciation":["일"]},{"id":"bd8fe9471c90dfb8","term":"넘다","zh":"过，超过","audio":"/audio/bd8fe9471c90dfb81875.mp3","entryId":"64524","definition":"超出一定时间、时期或范围等。","pronunciation":["넘ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/aeb48c4acb44f95237d6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57724-1-9-2","ko":"이러다 출석 미달로 유급이 되겠어요.","zh":"这样下去恐怕会因出勤不足而留级。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이러다","meaning":"这么着","explanation":"이러다：这么着；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"이러다","audio":"/audio/a42eace37d0e6c1863cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24838","senseId":"1","lemma":"이러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"출석","meaning":"出勤，出席，到场","explanation":"출석：出勤，出席，到场","readings":[{"term":"출석","audio":"/audio/6fe1c18a8a57574158a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79758","senseId":"1","lemma":"출석","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미달로","meaning":"未及，未达，不够","explanation":"미달：未及，未达，不够；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"미달","audio":"/audio/51b1dea0c663c1bf613b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57724","senseId":"1","lemma":"미달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"유급이","meaning":"留级，无法晋升","explanation":"유급：留级，无法晋升；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"유급","audio":"/audio/52d9484b04eb7c864b8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72404","senseId":"1","lemma":"유급","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되겠어요.","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a42eace37d0e6c18","term":"이러다","zh":"这么着","audio":"/audio/a42eace37d0e6c1863cb.mp3","entryId":"24838","definition":"这样做。","pronunciation":["이러다"]},{"id":"6fe1c18a8a575741","term":"출석","zh":"出勤，出席，到场","audio":"/audio/6fe1c18a8a57574158a0.mp3","entryId":"79758","definition":"上课或参加聚会等。","pronunciation":["출썩"]},{"id":"51b1dea0c663c1bf","term":"미달","zh":"未及，未达，不够","audio":"/audio/51b1dea0c663c1bf613b.mp3","entryId":"57724","definition":"未能达到某个水准或程度。","pronunciation":["미ː달"]},{"id":"52d9484b04eb7c86","term":"유급","zh":"留级，无法晋升","audio":"/audio/52d9484b04eb7c864b8a.mp3","entryId":"72404","definition":"学校或工作中，无法升入更高的学年或职位，留在原位。","pronunciation":["유급"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a03e3d1a61895336d717.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.084,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57724","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":147,"sequenceScore":2.9107,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["敏俊缺课已经超过六十天了。","这样下去恐怕会因出勤不足而留级。","夏天时，腋下很容易有汗味。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["敏俊缺课已经超过六十天了。","这样下去恐怕会因出勤不足而留级。","夏天时，腋下很容易有汗味。"],"answer":1}]}
